We grind them in dependency order, not numerical order. The objective is to create a proof-producing flywheel as early as possible.

\boxed{
\text{Freeze}\rightarrow
\text{Represent}\rightarrow
\text{Measure}\rightarrow
\text{Break}\rightarrow
\text{Improve}\rightarrow
\text{Transfer}
}

