Then we unleash Operator Wrestling

For operators A,B:

A(A(x))

A(B(x))

B(A(x))

A(B(A(x)))

and measure:

d(A\circ B,B\circ A)

That discovers:

commutators

[A,B]=AB-BA

involutions

A^2\approx I

idempotents

A^2\approx A

cycles

A^n(x)\approx x

amplifiers

Q(A^2x)>Q(Ax)

poison compositions

Q(A\circ B)<Q(A),Q(B)

Now we’re no longer merely naming cognitive techniques.

We’re experimentally discovering their algebra.

